00:17:10.080 --> 00:17:11.460
the bigger context here.

00:17:11.460 --> 00:17:13.470
The Industrial Area,
this little blue shape

00:17:13.470 --> 00:17:14.550
on the map is
(paper rustling)

00:17:14.550 --> 00:17:17.460
actually just one of several mechanisms

00:17:17.460 --> 00:17:20.280
that the Qatari government
uses to bring people

00:17:20.280 --> 00:17:23.100
over to their country to trap them there

00:17:23.100 --> 00:17:26.430
and then to exploit them to work to build

00:17:26.430 --> 00:17:28.662
all the things they want them to build.

00:17:28.662 --> 00:17:29.495
(paper rustling)
(pensive music)

00:17:29.495 --> 00:17:30.328
Lemme show you.

00:17:32.460 --> 00:17:34.260
Okay, so it's 2010.

00:17:34.260 --> 00:17:35.880
Qatar just won the World Cup bid.

00:17:35.880 --> 00:17:38.730
They have to build an unfathomable
amount of infrastructure

00:17:38.730 --> 00:17:39.900
in a very short time.

00:17:39.900 --> 00:17:41.670
They do this by paying a bunch of people

00:17:41.670 --> 00:17:44.550
to go to these countries,
to small villages

00:17:44.550 --> 00:17:47.370
in places like Bangladesh and Nepal

00:17:47.370 --> 00:17:50.370
to recruit a bunch of workers
to come to Qatar to build.

00:17:50.370 --> 00:17:51.630
And this is the first phase

00:17:51.630 --> 00:17:54.120
of what I'm calling the Qatar trap

00:17:54.120 --> 00:17:55.920
because it is here where
these workers were told

00:17:55.920 --> 00:17:57.840
they had to pay a recruitment fee,

00:17:57.840 --> 00:18:01.860
usually like one to $4,000
just to, like, get recruited

00:18:01.860 --> 00:18:03.360
to go to Qatar and work.

00:18:03.360 --> 00:18:06.570
These people don't have
one to $4,000 lying around.

00:18:06.570 --> 00:18:08.400
So, they often would
borrow money from family

00:18:08.400 --> 00:18:11.100
or take out a loan with
really high interest rates.

00:18:11.100 --> 00:18:13.020
So, even before they start working,

00:18:13.020 --> 00:18:16.710
they start their relationship
with work in Qatar with debt.

00:18:16.710 --> 00:18:19.440
So, now you have workers from
Bangladesh, India, Nepal,

00:18:19.440 --> 00:18:23.310
all over this region flooding
into Qatar to start building.

00:18:23.310 --> 00:18:25.759
As this is happening,
Qatar implements a law.

00:18:25.759 --> 00:18:26.790
(dramatic music)

00:18:26.790 --> 00:18:30.030
This is a law that's
meant to protect families.

00:18:30.030 --> 00:18:30.863
Okay.

00:18:30.863 --> 00:18:34.260
The law says that worker
groups are not allowed

00:18:34.260 --> 00:18:38.160
to live within, quote, "family
areas" in the city of Doha.

00:18:38.160 --> 00:18:39.240
It's a little ambiguous.

00:18:39.240 --> 00:18:40.950
Well, the government later clarified

00:18:40.950 --> 00:18:42.840
that what they're
referring to is bachelors,

00:18:42.840 --> 00:18:44.610
people in Qatar that are single men.

00:18:44.610 --> 00:18:47.520
Okay, so these bachelors
can't live in family zones.

00:18:47.520 --> 00:18:50.220
Where are these family zones
that bachelors can't live in?

00:18:50.220 --> 00:18:52.957
Is it just like one
little part of the city?

00:18:52.957 --> 00:18:53.790
(inquisitive music)
No.

00:18:53.790 --> 00:18:57.183
To clarify, they released
a map that looks like this.

00:18:59.100 --> 00:19:01.530
Everything in yellow is a family zone,

00:19:01.530 --> 00:19:04.140
a place where bachelor workers
are not allowed to live.

00:19:04.140 --> 00:19:06.180
If you project it onto, like, a real map,

00:19:06.180 --> 00:19:09.450
you will see that this is
the entire city, basically.

00:19:09.450 --> 00:19:13.110
And then, they reserved one
little plot of land a city away,

00:19:13.110 --> 00:19:16.770
still zoned for Doha,
this little blue shape,

00:19:16.770 --> 00:19:19.050
where these bachelor workers can live.

00:19:19.050 --> 00:19:20.730
Oh, but they made a few exceptions.

00:19:20.730 --> 00:19:23.250
Anyone who works at, like,
markets, and barber shops,

00:19:23.250 --> 00:19:26.370
restaurants, oh, and
white collar professionals

00:19:26.370 --> 00:19:28.800
who are bachelors can also
stay in the family zones.

00:19:28.800 --> 00:19:31.620
So, really these working
bachelors is just a euphemism

00:19:31.620 --> 00:19:34.260
for guys who look like this,

00:19:34.260 --> 00:19:36.330
guys who are there doing construction

00:19:36.330 --> 00:19:40.110
who Qatar does not want to see
in their shiny downtown area.

00:19:40.110 --> 00:19:41.760
So, they reserved them a spot out here

00:19:41.760 --> 00:19:43.560
in the desert next to the sewage pond.

00:19:43.560 --> 00:19:45.630
This is the map that sent
me down the rabbit hole,

00:19:45.630 --> 00:19:47.070
and now I see it for what it is.

00:19:47.070 --> 00:19:47.970
I knew something was up.

00:19:47.970 --> 00:19:50.220
I looked at a bunch of these
(censored) zoning maps.

00:19:50.220 --> 00:19:52.200
They're using this to put the people

00:19:52.200 --> 00:19:53.940
that they don't wanna see in the places

00:19:53.940 --> 00:19:55.140
that will never be seen.

00:19:57.030 --> 00:19:59.760
So, now these guys are
already laden with debt

00:19:59.760 --> 00:20:01.440
because of the recruiting fees,

00:20:01.440 --> 00:20:03.540
and now they're relegated and trapped

00:20:03.540 --> 00:20:06.060
into this part of the
city, the part of the city

00:20:06.060 --> 00:20:09.330
that I was not allowed to go
to without getting arrested.

00:20:09.330 --> 00:20:12.240
This is where Raj is on his way to.

00:20:12.240 --> 00:20:14.600
This is where we're getting footage from.

